& [PositiveCase]
  + a commission cannot gain an operation authority bound root bound resource or command not fixed by the signed formation
  + receipt verification rejects discontinuous operation sequences later work after failure per-process or cumulative-time overflow dishonest disposition conservation drift persistent executor processes and nested digest changes
  + strict canonical bytes duplicate-key rejection and cross-binding of toolchain and executor identities close representation and executable-substitution paths
  + the pure semantic module exposes no filesystem process environment clock network provider model service Cargo Git unsafe or remote-host effect surface

& [ChallengeCase]
  + commission and receipt verifiers link the same crate, so independence is fresh-process reconstruction and strict parsing rather than N-version implementation diversity
  + this core proves semantic admission and receipt honesty but cannot itself prove remote filesystem no-follow extraction process containment or actual executable bytes
  + a valid commission remains inert data until a separately published package and host harness receive explicit live authority

& [Resolution]
  + isolated evidence verification refuses raw source changes effect promotion remote-authority promotion and grant-count promotion
  + package verification must bind command-set and package-manifest digests, immutable custody, archive traversal/link refusal and exact service executable identity
  + live execution must stop on first refusal or failure and retain host-side records for independent replay

& [Decision]
  + approve publication of the provider-free host-free local semantic core checkpoint
  + keep package construction and every EVO-X2 effect locked until this implementation is published and immediately bookended
